  "bodyHash": "N7V6kOuWt8A=",
  "content": "<p><span>請別忘了你需要使用<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/1496369-151-147update-44-mcpatcher-hd-fix-303-01-245-04/\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPatcher</a>或<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/249637-151-optifine-hd-b3-fps-boost-hd-textures-aa-af-and-much-more/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>來讓這款材質包完美呈現，因為它使用了連接紋理。</span><br><br>大家好，<br><br>FancyCraft 變得更加華麗了！沒錯，就是如此。有一些原始紋理一直困擾我很長一段時間，比如說門的紋理，它們一點都不華麗。但現在不一樣了。我開始重新製作一些不符合標準的原始紋理。我將華麗程度提升到了最高！來看看全新的門，還有新的鵝卵石和石磚紋理吧。希望你們會喜歡。未來還會有更多更新！<br><br>JJJas0n 在 Minecraft 還很早期的時候就開始了這個精彩的材質包。FancyCraft 一直以來都是最優秀的高清材質包之一。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.dropbox.com%252fs%252fhdfdgw9bll3qb5j%252fScreenshot%2b2014-05-06%2b06.22.27.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">我已經向 JJJason 請求並獲得許可，重新啟動這個品牌。</a><br><br>其他人也曾努力延續這個材質包，但最終都放棄了。我從 JJJas0n 的最後一個版本重新開始。我努力保持 FancyCraft 最初設下的超高標準。請告訴我我是否成功，以及有哪些地方我還未達標。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/707/x64-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br>截圖感謝<a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/project/kabs-resource-pack-showcase/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kab's Resource Pack Showcase</a>！<br><br>原始材質包的製作人員：</p><ul>\n<li>字體來自 Misa 的材質包</li>\n<li>水、岩漿和環境紋理來自 Scuttle's Texture pack。他很慷慨地允許我使用這些紋理；它們看起來非常棒。</li>\n<li>這個材質包的靈感來自 Misa 和 Scuttle 的材質包。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/714/2016-02-26_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><br>授權/許可（法律上的繁文縟節）：</p><ul>\n<li>請獲得許可後再將此材質包的內容重複用於其他材質包。</li>\n<li>請獲得許可後再重新發布此內容。</li>\n<li>若要撰寫附帶截圖的評論，請註明出處並附上此帖的連結。</li>\n<li>若要使用此內容製作影片，請註明出處並附上此帖的連結。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/9/531/6440225889_c66d97a9f1_b.jpg\" alt=\"undefined\"><br><br>請告訴我你喜歡什麼，尤其是你不喜歡什麼。對於有問題的地方，如果你能告訴我為什麼不對勁，我很有可能會進行修復，至少會盡力嘗試。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/708/2016-02-26_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/709/2016-02-26_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/710/2016-02-26_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/711/2016-02-26_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/712/2016-02-26_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/713/2016-02-26_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><br></p><p>這些都是我所有的材質包，我相信裡面總有一款你會喜歡：<br><br></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/76115-axels-forgotten-lands-resource-p\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Axel's Forgotten Lands Realistic Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fortune-glory-jungle-ruins-textu/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Fortune &amp; Glory Jungle Ruins Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kab-pack-adventure/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 KabPack Adventure Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/236085-lord-trilobites-norsecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Lord Trilobite's Viking Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/darklands-medieval/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Darklands Medieval Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/even-time-x32-resource-pack/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 evenTime Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/223572-curse-cobalt-web-forms-textfield\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Athos Roman Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ad-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 TheVoid's AD-Reforged RPG Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/soulscribes-rezcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 Soulscribe's RezCraft Tron Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/221074-mrshortees-bladecraft-cyberpunk-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 MrShortee's Bladecraft Cyberpunk Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Xaiwaker：</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/222577-xaiwaker-x16-swirly-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Swirly Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/222516-xaiwaker-x32-swirly-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Swirly Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>The Doctor：</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/the-doctor-x16-whovian-texture-p/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/the-doctor-x32-whovian-texture-p/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/the-doctor-x32-tardis-2-0-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 TARDIS 2.0 Map Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's Photobased：</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x16-calorie-reduced/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 實體照片材質包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-photo-based/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 實體照片材質包</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's Technic：</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-tekkit/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Classic 3.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/k32-tekkit-classic-313/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Classic 3.1.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-tekkit-lite-0-5-9/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Lite 0.6.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-tekkit-a-new-fron/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit 1.2.9g</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/kyctarniqs-tekkit-legends-texture-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Legends 1.1.1</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's FTB：</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-mindcrack-tex/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Mindcrack 1.4.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-ultimate-text/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Ultimate 1.4.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-direwolf20-re/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Direwolf20 1.7.10</a></li>\n<li><strong>FancyCraft：</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fancy-craft-x32-classy-resource/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 經典材質包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fancy-craft-x64-classy-resource/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 經典材質包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/79523-fancy-craft-x128-classy-resource\" rel=\"nofollow\">x128 經典材質包</a></li>\n</ul>",
